{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object. If not visible scan area, if approached then grab it. Process object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToClosestObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
    "BT": {
